{
  "key": 63854,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "CanalaveGym_Text_ByronIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah!\n",
        "That’s Oreburgh’s Gym Badge!\r",
        "I see, I see!\n",
        "You’ve defeated my son.\r",
        "But that’s no surprise.\n",
        "He still has much to learn.\r",
        "In place of my son Roark, I, Byron,\n",
        "will take your challenge!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ah!\n",
        "C’est le Badge d’Arène de Charbourg!\r",
        "Je vois, je vois!\n",
        "Tu as vaincu mon fils.\r",
        "Enfin, ce n’est pas étonnant.\n",
        "Il a encore beaucoup à apprendre.\r",
        "Moi, Charles, saurai être à la hauteur,\n",
        "contrairement à mon fils Pierrick!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveGym_Text_BeatByron",
      "en_US": [
        "You were strong enough to take down\n",
        "my prized team of Pokémon.\r",
        "In recognition of that power,\n",
        "I give you this: the Mine Badge!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tu as assez de talent pour venir à bout\n",
        "de ma grande équipe de Pokémon.\r",
        "En reconnaissance de ta puissance,\n",
        "je te confie ceci: le Badge Mine!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveGym_Text_ByronReceiveMineBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} received\n",
        "the Mine Badge from Byron!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} obtient le\n",
        "Badge Mine de Charles!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveGym_Text_ByronExplainMineBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Having the Mine Badge enables you to\n",
        "use the hidden move Strength anytime\f",
        "outside of battle.\r",
        "And you now have six Gym Badges.\r",
        "That means all Pokémon up to Lv. 70\n",
        "will obey you without question.\r",
        "Here!\n",
        "Take this, too!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Ce Badge permet d’utiliser la capacité\n",
        "Force en dehors du combat.\r",
        "Tu possèdes maintenant six Badges.\r",
        "Cela signifie que les Pokémon t’obéiront\n",
        "au doigt et à l’œil jusqu’au N. 70.\r",
        "Tiens!\n",
        "Prends également ceci!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveGym_Text_ByronExplainTM91",
      "en_US": [
        "That {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} contains the move\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r",
        "If it hits, it may also lower the\n",
        "target’s Special Defense."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "La {STRVAR_1 8, 0, 0} contient la\n",
        "capacité {STRVAR_1 6, 1, 0}.\r",
        "Elle peut réduire la Défense Spéciale\n",
        "de la cible quand elle fait mouche."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveGym_Text_ByronAfterBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Gwahahahaha!\n",
        "The Sinnoh region is vast!\r",
        "Tough Trainers like you and\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0} crop up constantly\f",
        "to challenge the old guard!\r",
        "With more young Trainers like my son\n",
        "and you two taking charge, the\f",
        "future of Pokémon is bright!\r",
        "But I’m not stepping aside just yet!\r",
        "I merely need to rededicate myself\n",
        "to training on Iron Island."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Gwahahahaha!\n",
        "La région de Sinnoh est vaste!\r",
        "Tous les jours, de nouveaux Dresseurs\n",
        "coriaces comme toi et {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}\f",
        "viennent défier les anciens!\r",
        "Le futur des Pokémon est assuré avec\n",
        "des Dresseurs aussi doués que mon\f",
        "fils et vous deux!\r",
        "Mais je n’ai pas dit mon dernier mot!\r",
        "Je dois à nouveau reprendre mon\n",
        "entraînement sur l’Ile de Fer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveGym_Text_GymGuideBeforeBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Hey, there!\n",
        "Champ-to-be!\r",
        "The Gym Leader here uses Steel-type\n",
        "Pokémon.\r",
        "Steel-type Pokémon have high Defense,\n",
        "so you’d have to hit them hard!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Hé, toi!\n",
        "Futur Maître!\r",
        "Le Champion d’Arène du coin utilise des\n",
        "Pokémon de type Acier.\r",
        "Les types Acier ont une excellente \n",
        "défense, il faut les frapper fort!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveGym_Text_GymGuideAfterBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "You’ve beaten the Gym Leader!\r",
        "Good going!\n",
        "That makes it six Gym Badges!\r",
        "I tell you what, you’re really turning\n",
        "into one fine Trainer.\r",
        "If you were to say you’re going to\n",
        "try to become the Pokémon Champ...\r",
        "No one’d laugh at you now!\n",
        "I’m in your corner, kiddo!"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Oh! {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\n",
        "Tu as vaincu le Champion d’Arène!\r",
        "Bien joué!\n",
        "Te voilà avec six Badges d’Arène!\r",
        "Tu es en bonne voie pour devenir un\n",
        "Dresseur d’exception, pas de doute.\r",
        "Si tu clamais vouloir devenir le prochain\n",
        "Maître Pokémon...\r",
        "Personne n’oserait se moquer de toi!\n",
        "Tu as mon soutien, petite tête!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveGym_Text_GymStatueBeforeBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Canalave City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Byron\r",
        "Certified Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Arène Pokémon de Joliberges\n",
        "Champion: Charles\r",
        "Nouveau Dresseur reconnu:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "CanalaveGym_Text_GymStatueAfterBadge",
      "en_US": [
        "Canalave City Pokémon Gym\n",
        "Leader: Byron\r",
        "Certified Trainers:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}\f",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Arène Pokémon de Joliberges\n",
        "Champion: Charles\r",
        "Nouveaux Dresseurs reconnus:\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}\f",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}"
      ]
    }
  ]
